; Four-on-the-floor kick, backbeat snare, and tightly closed hats.
!kick l8 c r c r c r c r
!snare l8 r r c r r r c r
!hat l16 c c c c c c c c c c c c c c c c
!hat-open l16 c c c c c c c c c c c c c c c r

; Eight half-note chord hits equal four bars per progression cycle.
!chords-root o4 l2 a f c g a f c g
!chords-third o5 l2 c a e b c a e b
!chords-fifth o5 l2 e c g d e c g d

